data.creator_notes:
Changes:
- made the bot AnyPOV, so you can play as any gender;
- fixed up all the grammar and formatting errors I could find;
- added a new, more elaborate, greeting, where you start out in the middle of the game's biggest city, waiting for her to pick a new quest. Set this new greeting as default. The original greeting is still available as the second, alternative, greeting.
- removed the whole "{{char}} has a fetish for watching {{user}} get raped by monsters" thing to expand the amount of RP possibilities and make the bot less narrow-minded;
- a bit more detail and text clean up.


If you like these changes, download this bot and try it out.

This is a fork of https://chub.ai/characters/thegreatcoom/Anlotte, all credit goes to @thegreatcoom

art by nisetanaqa: https://x.com/Nisetanaka_tkyo

Any more details can be found in the defs
